    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Presenting to the market, number 12 Upper Bridge Street, a two bedroom townhouse set in the heart of Belturbet and on the doorstep to all local amenities.  Recently refurbished throughout, it comprises of welcoming entrance hallway with guest WC, and a living room. The kitchen is fully equipped and plumbed for all appliances, with a dining area and access to a rear patio area. Upstairs are two bedrooms and family bathroom finished to a high standard.  It is heated by an air to water heat pump.   The property would be ideal for anyone who would like to put their own stamp on their forever home or would be an ideal property investment.  Viewing highly recommended. \r\n\r\nMore about the location... Situated in Belturbet just 15 minutes outside Cavan and 10 minutes from Ballyconnell. A range of good creches, schools, walks, pharmacies and restaurants are close by. The M3 means Dublin is only a 90-minute drive away. Castle Saunderson, Killykeen Forest Park and the Slieve Russel Hotel have lovely walks and an 18-hole Golf Course which is very close by. While Cuilcagh Boardwalk which is nicknamed the Stairway to Heaven is approximately 30 minutes away."
      },
      {
